  "title": "Global Shared Stories - block stories from a user?",
  "summary": "I really like the new shared stories view - it’s a nice feed of interesting articles I usually haven’t seen. It’s especially useful when I’ve read all my subscriptions but am bored and want more to read 🙂 That said, one frustration I have is amidst the good content is the occasional item that is pure nonsense. As much as I like hearing diverse opinions, I don’t need articles that are hateful, racist, or offensive. Just not my jam. It would be nice if I could just hide articles sha...",
